01:32:58,970 --> 01:32:59,070
Health!

1726
01:32:59,730 --> 01:32:59,950
Link!

1727
01:33:01,450 --> 01:33:02,850
Oh, there we go!

1728
01:33:02,850 --> 01:33:03,690
We're so back.

1729
01:33:05,710 --> 01:33:06,290
Incredible.

1730
01:33:16,810 --> 01:33:17,390
Nice.

1731
01:33:21,560 --> 01:33:25,160
Now we gotta move this all the way to the back so we can push the big block off the edge.

1732
01:33:25,300 --> 01:33:27,920
And then I guess we gotta go down there and pluck the hole.

1733
01:33:33,350 --> 01:33:34,130
