What?

1738
01:33:46,900 --> 01:33:48,260
It can't get aligned properly?

1739
01:33:49,880 --> 01:33:50,760
That's gonna bother me.

1740
01:34:02,260 --> 01:34:03,000
Okay, that's fine.

1741
01:34:04,200 --> 01:34:04,300
No.

1742
01:34:04,460 --> 01:34:05,120
Link, link, link, link.

1743
01:34:05,700 --> 01:34:06,400
Wait, where am I?

1744
01:34:07,820 --> 01:34:08,920
I thought I was somewhere else.

1745
01:34:09,060 --> 01:34:09,240
Just...

1746
01:34:09,240 --> 01:34:10,100
Oh, link, link, link.

1747
01:34:10,300 --> 01:34:11,040
I swear to God.

1748
01:34:12,740 --> 01:34:13,100
Grab.

1749
01:34:13,600 --> 01:34:13,960
Push.

1750
01:34:30,000 --> 01:34:30,660
What was that?

1751
01:34:33,320 --> 01:34:34,700
What the hell just happened?

1752
01:34:39,990 --> 01:34:41,270
Oh, I can't even...

1753
01:34:41,270 --> 01:34:41,570
Hmm.

1754
01:34:46,760 --> 01:34:48,420
Well, what the hell is the point of this, then?

1755
01:34:54,110 --> 01:34:54,910
Oh, my God.

1756
01:34:54,990 --> 01:34:56,130
We just found a bunch of bombs.

1757
01:35:10,710 --> 01:35:11,710
I hate that.

1758
01:35:16,900 --> 01:35:19,540
Oh, I almost got both of them at the same time.

1759
01:35:19,900 --> 01:35:20,120
Imagine.

1760
01:35:21,680 --> 01:35:23,940
Link, stop pulling out the bombs.

1761
01:35:24,680 --> 01:35:29,920
I hate that these items are bound to the control stick of all things.

1762
01:35:31,980 --> 01:35:34,900
Like, what the hell is that even?

1763
01:35:44,620 --> 01:35:46,480
Okay, now go do this.

1764
01:35:55,580 --> 01:35:57,000
Okay, I think it's about boss time.

1765
01:36:02,920 --> 01:36:03,580
Are we ready?

1766
01:36:04,480 --> 01:36:05,720
What do we think we need for this?

1767
01:36:06,080 --> 01:36:07,900
Probably put on a shield, actually, would be smart.

1768
01:36:12,580 --> 01:36:14,280
Do we play him the song of our people?

1769
01:36:19,800 --> 01:36:20,900
Let me keep these nuts.

1770
01:36:31,530 --> 01:36:32,430
You got bombs!

1771
01:36:32,630 --> 01:36:34,370
Okay, so I guess bombs are gonna be useful here.

1772
01:36:38,330 --> 01:36:39,710
Press evil running to throw it.

1773
01:36:39,790 --> 01:36:41,310
If you see something suspicious, bomb it.

1774
01:36:42,110 --> 01:36:43,310
That's great life advice.

1775
01:36:46,910 --> 01:36:48,610
I mean, I hear something suspicious.

1776
01:36:55,260 --> 01:36:56,740
I feel like the floor is suspicious.

1777
01:37:01,330 --> 01:37:01,870
Uh-huh.

1778
01:37:02,290 --> 01:37:02,570
Yeah.

1779
01:37:09,660 --> 01:37:11,320
Am I safe to jump down there?

1780
01:37:13,880 --> 01:37:14,900
I'm gonna die.

1781
01:37:18,310 --> 01:37:18,730
Hello?

1782
01:37:28,030 --> 01:37:28,770
Alright, fine.

1783
01:37:31,530 --> 01:37:33,010
Okay, we're totally fine.

1784
01:37:37,070 --> 01:37:37,610
Uh-oh.

1785
01:37:39,670 --> 01:37:40,870
Let's see what his gimmick is.

1786
01:37:41,750 --> 01:37:44,010
There's definitely fire in the center we don't want to step on.

1787
01:37:45,750 --> 01:37:47,090
Uh, Link, how about you run?

1788
01:37:48,610 --> 01:37:49,090
Oh.

1789
01:37:50,390 --> 01:37:51,350
Infernal dinosaur.

1790
01:37:51,690 --> 01:37:52,490
King Dodongo!

1791
01:37:54,470 --> 01:37:55,230
Run, Link!

1792
01:37:56,930 --> 01:37:58,410
Run, run, run, run, run, run, run, run!

1793
01:37:58,930 --> 01:37:59,870
What is he doing?

1794
01:38:00,230 --> 01:38:01,470
Oh, he's about to...

1795
01:38:01,470 --> 01:38:02,530
Billows on fire.

1796
01:38:04,130 --> 01:38:04,810
Oh, shit!

1797
01:38:04,990 --> 01:38:05,970
It reaches all the way around.

1798
01:38:07,410 --> 01:38:08,510
Oh, crap.

1799
01:38:12,010 --> 01:38:14,050
Oh, he gets stunned over there on the corner.

1800
01:38:14,190 --> 01:38:14,310
Okay.

1801
01:38:18,590 --> 01:38:19,190
Damn it.

1802
01:38:24,200 --> 01:38:24,680
Wow.

1803
01:38:26,360 --> 01:38:27,720
Keep running, keep running, keep running.

1804
01:38:27,940 --> 01:38:28,720
We want to get behind him.

1805
01:38:35,980 --> 01:38:36,860
Where are you, sir?

1806
01:38:40,840 --> 01:38:41,600
You gonna get stunned?

1807
01:38:45,220 --> 01:38:45,880
There he is.

1808
01:38:47,040 --> 01:38:47,780
Sock on these nuts!

1809
01:38:49,220 --> 01:38:50,000
Oh, my God.

1810
01:38:50,160 --> 01:38:50,300
Really?

1811
01:38:52,920 --> 01:38:54,120
How are we gonna catch up to him?

1812
01:38:59,830 --> 01:39:00,930
Starts rolling immediately.

1813
01:39:06,100 --> 01:39:06,680
There we go.

1814
01:39:10,930 --> 01:39:11,830
Did I hurt him?

1815
01:39:22,150 --> 01:39:22,950
No, Link!

1816
01:39:34,940 --> 01:39:35,920
Gotta hit him in the back.

1817
01:39:39,240 --> 01:39:40,340
No, it doesn't work.

1818
01:39:41,300 --> 01:39:42,580
Maybe with the...

1819
01:39:42,580 --> 01:39:44,120
Maybe with flashbanging.

1820
01:39:49,180 --> 01:39:49,800
Hit him!

1821
01:39:50,880 --> 01:39:51,720
Oh, God!

1822
01:39:54,940 --> 01:39:55,640
Did I hurt him?

1823
01:39:55,900 --> 01:39:56,740
I hurt myself.

1824
01:40:02,160 --> 01:40:03,100
Come on, come on, come on, come on.

1825
01:40:05,200 --> 01:40:05,720
Navi!

1826
01:40:06,660 --> 01:40:07,480
King Dodongo!

1827
01:40:07,480 --> 01:40:09,980
This is a huge Dodongo that eats anything.

1828
01:40:10,480 --> 01:40:12,720
Give it a shock and finish it off with your sword.

1829
01:40:14,200 --> 01:40:15,540
I mean, that's what I'm trying to do.

1830
01:40:16,560 --> 01:40:17,700
I'm trying to do exactly that.

1831
01:40:25,750 --> 01:40:26,630
No, where are you going?

1832
01:40:26,950 --> 01:40:27,390
No!

1833
01:40:29,170 --> 01:40:29,610
Bastard!

1834
01:40:30,770 --> 01:40:31,470
Navi, what is it?

1835
01:40:33,310 --> 01:40:34,550
I hurt you the first time.

1836
01:40:36,830 --> 01:40:38,030
Okay, I'm not sure what to do here.

1837
01:40:38,850 --> 01:40:39,750
Let's try and run the other way.

1838
01:40:45,710 --> 01:40:46,270
Turtle moat!

1839
01:40:46,710 --> 01:40:47,110
Oh, oh!

1840
01:40:52,070 --> 01:40:52,570
Did I hit you?

1841
01:40:56,000 --> 01:40:56,940
He's going the other way now!

1842
01:41:03,940 --> 01:41:04,420
Oh, God.

1843
01:41:04,880 --> 01:41:05,760
Oh, here we go, here we go!

1844
01:41:12,890 --> 01:41:13,790
Am I damaging you?

1845
01:41:19,150 --> 01:41:19,430
Dodongo!

1846
01:41:19,690 --> 01:41:19,910
Come here!

1847
01:41:23,700 --> 01:41:24,020
No!

1848
01:41:30,620 --> 01:41:31,980
I need you to cast fire on me.

1849
01:41:32,060 --> 01:41:32,500
Can you do that?

1850
01:41:34,500 --> 01:41:35,060
There we go.

1851
01:41:40,610 --> 01:41:40,930
Okay.

1852
01:41:43,870 --> 01:41:44,190
What?

1853
01:41:48,200 --> 01:41:48,880
Okay, let's...

1854
01:41:48,880 --> 01:41:49,560
Oh, I have an idea.

1855
01:41:49,720 --> 01:41:50,580
We're going to throw it in his mouth.

1856
01:41:51,660 --> 01:41:54,460
He's going to breathe fire, but I'm going to throw a bomb in there instead.

1857
01:41:55,420 --> 01:41:56,500
He's going to love this part.

1858
01:42:02,130 --> 01:42:04,190
That is the ultimate strategy a hero would employ.

1859
01:42:05,830 --> 01:42:06,810
Bro, where are you going?

1860
01:42:06,830 --> 01:42:07,030
Where are you going?

1861
01:42:07,210 --> 01:42:07,490
Come on!

1862
01:42:07,750 --> 01:42:08,650
Breathe fire on me!

1863
01:42:09,470 --> 01:42:10,490
Alright, let's go the other way.

1864
01:42:14,860 --> 01:42:15,300
Fire!

1865
01:42:17,220 --> 01:42:17,740
Suck it!

1866
01:42:18,920 --> 01:42:19,360
Yes!

1867
01:42:20,840 --> 01:42:21,640
Oh, yeah!

1868
01:42:23,420 --> 01:42:24,040
Oh, fuck.

1869
01:42:24,120 --> 01:42:24,760
We've got to hit him in the face.

1870
01:42:28,230 --> 01:42:28,670
Yeah!

1871
01:42:29,010 --> 01:42:29,650
That's how you do it.

1872
01:42:29,770 --> 01:42:30,050
Okay.

1873
01:42:30,890 --> 01:42:31,630
Good stuff.

1874
01:42:33,730 --> 01:42:34,510
Good stuff.

1875
01:42:35,950 --> 01:42:37,150
You're going to breathe fire now?

1876
01:42:41,570 --> 01:42:42,330
There we go.

1877
01:42:42,330 --> 01:42:42,410
There we go!

1878
01:42:47,070 --> 01:42:47,830
Crap!

1879
01:42:48,910 --> 01:42:49,290
Wee!

1880
01:42:49,870 --> 01:42:50,550
Get away.

1881
01:42:57,540 --> 01:42:58,480
Open up!

1882
01:42:59,680 --> 01:43:00,320
Ha ha ha!

1883
01:43:04,750 --> 01:43:05,130
Shit!

1884
01:43:05,470 --> 01:43:05,790
Leg!

1885
01:43:05,990 --> 01:43:06,570
Oh, that was close.

1886
01:43:15,430 --> 01:43:16,530
There you go!

1887
01:43:17,250 --> 01:43:17,850
Ha ha ha!

1888
01:43:20,430 --> 01:43:21,190
Yeah!

1889
01:43:22,650 --> 01:43:23,410
Doudongo!

1890
01:43:24,770 --> 01:43:25,770
It's dead.

1891
01:43:26,190 --> 01:43:27,150
I think.

1892
01:43:37,110 --> 01:43:38,570
Yeah, fall in the lava.

1893
01:43:39,950 --> 01:43:41,370
You evil creature.

1894
01:43:48,800 --> 01:43:50,680
Now the Gorons can eat rocks again.

1895
01:43:51,460 --> 01:43:52,040
Oh, heart.

1896
01:43:54,040 --> 01:43:54,600
Huge.

1897
01:43:56,280 --> 01:43:57,440
A heart container.

1898
01:44:00,480 --> 01:44:04,460
I'm also, uh, three-fourths of the way there to another full heart.

1899
01:44:06,980 --> 01:44:08,420
I gotta get a quarter more.

1900
01:44:08,600 --> 01:44:08,800
Sir.

1901
01:44:13,200 --> 01:44:14,380
Can I do anything with you?

1902
01:44:14,920 --> 01:44:15,480
Okay.

1903
01:44:16,540 --> 01:44:17,340
Let's go.

1904
01:44:23,430 --> 01:44:24,650
Ascend to the heavens.

1905
01:44:28,220 --> 01:44:29,320
Such a hero.

1906
01:44:35,170 --> 01:44:36,190
Oh, here we go.

1907
01:44:39,840 --> 01:44:40,600
It's me!

1908
01:44:41,000 --> 01:44:41,640
Darunia!

1909
01:44:42,040 --> 01:44:42,960
Well done.

1910
01:44:44,220 --> 01:44:44,860
Wow.

1911
01:44:45,200 --> 01:44:46,020
You hit me in the face.

1912
01:44:46,780 --> 01:44:50,680
Thanks to you, we can once again eat the delicious rocks from the Dodongo's cavern.

1913
01:44:50,920 --> 01:44:52,540
Until our stomachs burst.

1914
01:44:54,580 --> 01:44:56,080
What a wild adventure.

1915
01:44:56,480 --> 01:44:58,120
It will make an incredible story.

1916
01:44:59,540 --> 01:45:03,600
I can't believe that the Dodongo suddenly appeared in such great numbers.

1917
01:45:04,560 --> 01:45:08,240
And that big block, rock blocking the cave.

1918
01:45:08,500 --> 01:45:09,180
I know, right?

1919
01:45:09,380 --> 01:45:10,160
What's up with that?

1920
01:45:10,780 --> 01:45:15,020
All this trouble must have been caused by that Gerudo thief, Ganondorf.

1921
01:45:16,000 --> 01:45:18,100
What a silly name.

1922
01:45:18,800 --> 01:45:21,860
He said, Give me the spiritual stone.

1923
01:45:22,400 --> 01:45:24,080
Only then will I open the cave for you.

1924
01:45:24,900 --> 01:45:25,220
Wow.

1925
01:45:26,520 --> 01:45:26,960
Extortion.

1926
01:45:27,660 --> 01:45:30,020
You, on the other hand, risked your life for us.

1927
01:45:31,760 --> 01:45:33,120
Kit, I like you.

1928
01:45:34,640 --> 01:45:36,820
How's about you and I become sworn brothers?

1929
01:45:37,980 --> 01:45:38,700
Oh, hell yeah.

1930
01:45:39,720 --> 01:45:41,460
No, there's no big ceremony involved.

1931
01:45:41,720 --> 01:45:43,400
Just take this as a token of our friendship.

1932
01:45:46,870 --> 01:45:47,850
What are you going to give me?

1933
01:45:49,350 --> 01:45:51,570
Why was I bowing like that?

1934
01:45:51,650 --> 01:45:52,530
Oh, I guess he's a king.

1935
01:46:02,260 --> 01:46:03,760
Oh, the red stone!

1936
01:46:03,900 --> 01:46:04,420
The ruby!

1937
01:46:10,190 --> 01:46:10,690
Beautiful.

1938
01:46:17,260 --> 01:46:19,480
You obtained the Goron's ruby.

1939
01:46:20,100 --> 01:46:23,780
This is the spiritual stone of fire passed down by the Gorons.

1940
01:46:26,690 --> 01:46:28,910
You don't know what he means by sworn brothers.

1941
01:46:29,570 --> 01:46:31,470
But you've collected two spiritual stones.

1942
01:46:32,110 --> 01:46:33,410
We have one more to find.

1943
01:46:34,190 --> 01:46:34,950
Oh, hell yeah.

1944
01:46:36,170 --> 01:46:36,490
Brother!

1945
01:46:37,170 --> 01:46:39,990
You'll keep brushing up on your skills as you travel, won't you?

1946
01:46:40,690 --> 01:46:41,170
Of course.

1947
01:46:42,210 --> 01:46:44,750
You should go see the great fairy on top of Death Mountain.

1948
01:46:45,230 --> 01:46:46,430
He will power you up.

1949
01:46:47,970 --> 01:46:48,710
Hey, everybody!

1950
01:46:49,290 --> 01:46:50,310
Let's see off our brother.

1951
01:46:55,320 --> 01:46:57,280
I like to just come in from the sky.

1952
01:46:59,400 --> 01:47:01,460
How about a big Goron hug, brother?

1953
01:47:04,160 --> 01:47:05,140
Get out of there, Link!

1954
01:47:06,460 --> 01:47:07,640
Don't let him get close to you.

1955
01:47:09,120 --> 01:47:10,240
That's actually kind of scary.

1956
01:47:10,420 --> 01:47:11,460
We don't want to get hugged by these guys.

1957
01:47:12,360 --> 01:47:13,480
I do want to talk to them, though.

1958
01:47:14,240 --> 01:47:14,920
This guy's back.

1959
01:47:15,040 --> 01:47:15,240
Yo!

1960
01:47:16,120 --> 01:47:16,660
What are you doing?

1961
01:47:17,300 --> 01:47:17,940
Get out of here.

1962
01:47:19,020 --> 01:47:19,280
You!

1963
01:47:19,280 --> 01:47:20,480
Did you see my heroic actions?

1964
01:47:24,570 --> 01:47:25,530
You're incredible!

1965
01:47:25,990 --> 01:47:27,390
Destroying the Dodongos?

1966
01:47:27,750 --> 01:47:29,690
Do you mind if I call you big brother?

1967
01:47:30,590 --> 01:47:31,250
Hell yeah.

1968
01:47:31,750 --> 01:47:32,690
Except I'm not very big.

1969
01:47:33,210 --> 01:47:34,230
I'm a tiny man.

1970
01:47:34,870 --> 01:47:36,270
Why am I so tiny, anyway?

1971
01:47:37,110 --> 01:47:38,530
It's the same with Breath of the Wild.

1972
01:47:39,350 --> 01:47:39,710
Like...

1973
01:47:40,230 --> 01:47:42,690
It felt like I was a 13-year-old running around, you know?

1974
01:47:42,810 --> 01:47:43,530
Like, what's up with that?

1975
01:47:44,390 --> 01:47:45,050
Maybe I'm not.

1976
01:47:45,150 --> 01:47:46,370
Maybe it's just, you know...

1977
01:47:46,370 --> 01:47:47,270
I'm just tiny.

1978
01:47:50,360 --> 01:47:52,840
They say that a fairy lives on top of Death Mountain.

1979
01:47:53,960 --> 01:47:55,520
If you want to make it to the top...

1980
01:47:55,520 --> 01:47:57,420
You better take a big shield with you.

1981
01:48:00,100 --> 01:48:00,460
Uh...

1982
01:48:00,460 --> 01:48:00,840
Wait a minute.

1983
01:48:01,460 --> 01:48:01,820
Yeah!

1984
01:48:02,840 --> 01:48:03,720
I'm down for that.

1985
01:48:04,220 --> 01:48:06,260
Oh, I probably need more bombs for this.

1986
01:48:07,460 --> 01:48:08,720
I don't have a lot right now.

1987
01:48:12,580 --> 01:48:13,620
We have six bombs?

1988
01:48:14,740 --> 01:48:15,100
Hmm...

1989
01:48:15,100 --> 01:48:15,600
Is it enough?

1990
01:48:17,820 --> 01:48:19,060
Maybe we go buy some more.

1991
01:48:20,220 --> 01:48:20,800
Oh my god.

1992
01:48:20,880 --> 01:48:21,720
Careful there, sir.

1993
01:48:22,900 --> 01:48:23,780
You almost hit me.

1994
01:48:26,540 --> 01:48:29,420
Now, we have this bomb over here, but that can't be added to my bag, I don't think.

1995
01:48:30,380 --> 01:48:31,560
Maybe I'll find bombs here.

1996
01:48:35,510 --> 01:48:38,290
These things reveal, uh, what your heart desires, right?

1997
01:48:43,020 --> 01:48:44,140
Which, right now...

1998
01:48:44,980 --> 01:48:46,120
Is money, apparently.

1999
01:48:51,980 --> 01:48:52,340
Okay.

2000
01:48:55,160 --> 01:48:55,520
Alright.

2001
01:48:55,760 --> 01:48:56,580
I guess that's good.

2002
01:48:56,720 --> 01:48:58,360
I mean, we needed money for this shop anyway, right?

2003
01:49:02,420 --> 01:49:04,860
Okay, I'm gonna go down here, buy the bombs, then we're gonna take a break.

2004
01:49:06,120 --> 01:49:06,480
